I('plan',[2], 'title, date or page count',46,[3],[loc(P,10,57)],quote(P,29),'A revised EGA contents plan inserts Picard schemes and abelian varieties and separately lists torsors/cotorsors.', 'The ordering changes are not a dated programme or a proof of the Fourier claim in cote 47.','agrees','Read the plan; VIII and IX are programme headings, not independent mathematical witnesses.')
I('fourier_context',[3,4], 'idea of the earlier run',[46,47],[3,7,8],[loc(P,10,57)],quote(P,29),'The earlier run compares the Fourier-transform compatibility question in cote 47 with Mukai and Laumon; cote 46 supplies no second proof.', 'The modern derived formulation and witness independence are earlier-run/contextual reconstructions, not propositions on the cote-46 plan.','agrees','The cote-46 plan has no Fourier formula. The substantive cote-47 endpoint is assigned to the cote-47 reviewer.',{3:'kept',4:'merged'})
I('serre_jacobian',[5,6], 'idea of the earlier run',44,[2,8,9],[], 'Contextual letter comparison; no new quotation from cote 46.', 'Compare the 12 August 1964 Serre letter with the numbered Jacobian assertions in cote 44, distinguishing duplicate witnesses from independent support.', 'Dating and witness comparison are supplied by the earlier notes; cote 44 is outside the agent46 source assignment.','agrees','The entries identify context, not a theorem newly asserted in cote 46; the parent will merge with the cote-44 review.')
